{
  "_about": "Exercise-library glossary (issue #248): the one Chinese rendering of each English term, so the same word reads the same across the whole library. tools/translate_exercises.py gives the terms that occur in a batch to the translation model and checks every machine-translated name against them (a term in the English name whose Chinese is missing from the Chinese name is reported as a glossary miss). Matching is case-insensitive on whole words, longest term first; a value may list alternatives separated by '|' (the first one is preferred, any one counts as present). Sections are only for reading: all terms share one namespace. Edit here, never in the data file.",
